---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy - Data Protection & Cookie Policy | MahaSandhi" 
  description="Read the comprehensive Privacy Policy of MahaSandhi (mahasandhi.in). Learn how we collect, use, protect, and handle your personal data, cookie usage, Google AdSense, GDPR, CCPA, and DPDP compliance."
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-10 px-4 sm:px-6">
    <!-- Header Section -->
    <header class="mb-10 text-center sm:text-left border-b border-border-card pb-8">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        🔒 Legal & Compliance
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-text-main mb-4">
        Privacy <span class="gradient-text">Policy</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-text-muted text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        At <strong class="text-text-main">MahaSandhi</strong> (accessible from <a href="https://mahasandhi.in" class="text-primary hover:underline font-medium">mahasandhi.in</a>), protecting your personal privacy is one of our top priorities. This detailed Privacy Policy outlines the types of information we collect, how it is used, stored, and protected, as well as your legal rights.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-4 text-xs text-text-muted/80 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
        <span>📅 <strong>Last Updated:</strong> July 23, 2026</span>
        <span>🌐 <strong>Domain:</strong> mahasandhi.in</span>
        <span>📧 <strong>Contact:</strong> hello@mahasandhi.in</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Highlights Box -->
    <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12 shadow-sm">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-text-main mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
        ⚡ Privacy Policy at a Glance
      </h2>
      <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm text-text-muted">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">✓</span>
          <span>We do <strong>not</strong> sell or rent your personal data to third parties.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">✓</span>
          <span>We collect minimal data via contact forms and standard web log analytics.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">✓</span>
          <span>Cookies are used to improve navigation and serve relevant advertisements via Google AdSense.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-emerald-500 font-bold">✓</span>
          <span>Full compliance with GDPR, CCPA, and Indian DPDP (Digital Personal Data Protection) standards.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-md sm:prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-text-muted leading-relaxed space-y-10">

      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          1. Consent & Agreement
        </h2>
        <p>
          By accessing or using our website <strong class="text-text-main">mahasandhi.in</strong>, you hereby acknowledge that you have read, understood, and consented to the data collection and usage practices described in this Privacy Policy. If you do not agree with any part of this policy, please refrain from using our portal and services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          2. Information We Collect
        </h2>
        <p>
          We collect information in two main ways: directly when you provide it to us, and automatically as you navigate through the website.
        </p>
        
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-main mt-4 mb-2">A. Personal Data Provided Voluntarily</h3>
        <p>
          You may visit <strong class="text-text-main">mahasandhi.in</strong> anonymously without registering. However, if you interact with certain features (such as sending messages via our Contact Us page or subscribing to job notification updates), we may collect:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-sm sm:text-base">
          <li><strong>Full Name:</strong> To address your communication appropriately.</li>
          <li><strong>Email Address:</strong> To respond to inquiries, feedback, or support requests.</li>
          <li><strong>Message Content & Subject:</strong> Any details you voluntarily include in your query.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-main mt-6 mb-2">B. Information Collected Automatically (Log Files)</h3>
        <p>
          MahaSandhi follows standard industry procedures of using log files. These files automatically log visitors when they navigate websites. The information gathered includes:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-sm sm:text-base">
          <li>Internet Protocol (IP) address (anonymized where applicable)</li>
          <li>Browser type, language, and version</li>
          <li>Internet Service Provider (ISP)</li>
          <li>Date, time, and duration of visits</li>
          <li>Referring page URLs and exit pages</li>
          <li>Number of clicks and page navigation flows</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-muted/80 mt-2">
          <em>Note: Log file data is not linked to any personally identifiable information. It is strictly used for analyzing trends, administering the site, tracking user movement, and gathering demographic statistics.</em>
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          3. How We Use Your Information
        </h2>
        <p>
          We use the information we collect for legitimate operational purposes, including:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base">
          <li>Operating, maintaining, and improving <strong class="text-text-main">mahasandhi.in</strong>.</li>
          <li>Providing accurate updates regarding recruitment notices, MPSC/UPSC exam details, hall tickets, and admit cards.</li>
          <li>Responding directly to your support requests, inquiries, or feedback.</li>
          <li>Analyzing user traffic patterns to optimize layout performance and mobile accessibility.</li>
          <li>Detecting, preventing, and addressing technical issues, malicious activity, or fraudulent form submissions.</li>
          <li>Complying with applicable legal obligations and regulatory standards.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          4. Cookies and Web Beacons
        </h2>
        <p>
          Like almost all professional websites, MahaSandhi uses "cookies" and similar tracking technologies (such as local storage). A cookie is a small text file stored on your device that helps us optimize your browsing experience.
        </p>
        <div class="bg-black/5 dark:bg-white/5 border border-border-card rounded-xl p-5 my-4 space-y-3">
          <p class="text-sm"><strong>Essential Cookies:</strong> Required for fundamental site navigation and theme settings (dark/light mode preference).</p>
          <p class="text-sm"><strong>Performance & Analytics Cookies:</strong> Help us measure visitor counts and traffic sources to optimize page load speeds.</p>
          <p class="text-sm"><strong>Advertising Cookies:</strong> Used by third-party ad networks to serve relevant advertising content based on user interests.</p>
        </div>
        <p>
          You can choose to disable cookies through your individual browser options. Detailed information about cookie management with specific web browsers can be found at the browsers' respective official websites.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          5. Google DoubleClick DART Cookie & AdSense Policy
        </h2>
        <p>
          Google is a third-party vendor on our site. Google uses cookies, known as DART cookies, to serve ads to visitors based upon their visit to <strong class="text-text-main">mahasandhi.in</strong> and other websites across the internet.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base">
          <li>Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to our website.</li>
          <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on their visit to our site and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
          <li>Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline font-semibold">Google Ads Settings</a>. Alternatively, you can opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline font-semibold">aboutads.info</a>.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 6 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          6. Third-Party Advertising & Partner Policies
        </h2>
        <p>
          You may consult this list to find the Privacy Policy for each of the advertising partners of MahaSandhi. Third-party ad servers or ad networks use technologies like cookies, JavaScript, or Web Beacons that are used in their respective advertisements and links that appear on MahaSandhi, which are sent directly to users' browsers. They automatically receive your IP address when this occurs. These technologies are used to measure the effectiveness of their advertising campaigns and/or to personalize the advertising content that you see on websites that you visit.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm italic">
          Note: MahaSandhi has no access to or control over these cookies that are used by third-party advertisers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 7 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          7. Third-Party Links & External Portals
        </h2>
        <p>
          MahaSandhi contains hyperlinks to external websites, including official government recruitment portals (e.g., <code class="text-xs bg-black/10 dark:bg-white/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">mpsc.gov.in</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-black/10 dark:bg-white/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">cetcell.mahacet.org</code>, <code class="text-xs bg-black/10 dark:bg-white/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">digialm.com</code>) and social community groups (such as Telegram and WhatsApp channels).
        </p>
        <p>
          MahaSandhi's Privacy Policy does not apply to other advertisers, government portals, or third-party websites. Thus, we strongly advise you to consult the respective Privacy Policies of these external sites for more detailed information regarding their data practices and opt-out procedures.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 8 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          8. Your Privacy Rights & Data Protection
        </h2>
        <p>
          Depending on your location, you hold specific legal rights regarding your personal information:
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-main mt-4 mb-2">A. Indian DPDP (Digital Personal Data Protection) Act Compliance</h3>
        <p>
          In accordance with Indian data protection laws, Indian citizens have the right to request information about personal data processed, request correction or erasure of incomplete or inaccurate data, and register grievances regarding data privacy.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-main mt-6 mb-2">B. GDPR Data Protection Rights (European Economic Area)</h3>
        <p>If you are a resident of the European Economic Area (EEA), you have the following rights:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-sm sm:text-base">
          <li><strong>The Right to Access:</strong> Request copies of your personal data.</li>
          <li><strong>The Right to Rectification:</strong> Request correction of any inaccurate or incomplete information.</li>
          <li><strong>The Right to Erasure:</strong> Request deletion of your personal data under certain conditions.</li>
          <li><strong>The Right to Restrict & Object to Processing:</strong> Request restrictions on how we process your data.</li>
          <li><strong>The Right to Data Portability:</strong> Request transfer of collected data to another organization.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-main mt-6 mb-2">C. CCPA / CPRA Privacy Rights (California Residents)</h3>
        <p>Under the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA), California consumers have the right to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-sm sm:text-base">
          <li>Request disclosure of the categories and specific pieces of personal data collected.</li>
          <li>Request deletion of any personal data collected.</li>
          <li>Request that a business that sells or shares consumer data not sell or share their personal data. (MahaSandhi does <strong>not</strong> sell personal data).</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4 font-medium text-text-main">
          If you make a request, we have one month to respond to you. If you would like to exercise any of these rights, please contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@mahasandhi.in" class="text-primary hover:underline font-semibold">hello@mahasandhi.in</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 9 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          9. Children's Information
        </h2>
        <p>
          Another key priority is adding protection for children while using the internet. We encourage parents and guardians to observe, participate in, and/or monitor and guide their online activity.
        </p>
        <p>
          MahaSandhi does not knowingly collect any Personal Identifiable Information from children under the age of 13. If you believe that your child provided this kind of information on our website, we strongly encourage you to contact us immediately, and we will make best efforts to promptly remove such information from our records.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 10 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          10. Data Security Standards
        </h2>
        <p>
          We implement standard security measures, including SSL encryption (HTTPS protocol), access controls, and secure server hosting environments to protect your information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. However, please note that no internet transmission is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 11 -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-main mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          11. Changes to This Privacy Policy
        </h2>
        <p>
          We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in legal requirements or website practices. We will notify you of any changes by updating the "Last Updated" date at the top of this Privacy Policy. You are advised to review this Privacy Policy periodically for any updates.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 12 -->
      <section class="bg-primary/5 border border-primary/20 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 mt-12">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-main mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          12. Contact Us & Privacy Officer
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base mb-4">
          If you have any questions, concerns, suggestions, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or our privacy practices, please do not hesitate to contact our team:
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-sm text-text-main font-medium">
          <p>📧 <strong>Email Address:</strong> <a href="mailto:hello@mahasandhi.in" class="text-primary hover:underline font-bold">hello@mahasandhi.in</a></p>
          <p>🌐 <strong>Official Website:</strong> <a href="https://mahasandhi.in" class="text-primary hover:underline font-bold">mahasandhi.in</a></p>
          <p>📝 <strong>Contact Page:</strong> <a href="/contact-us" class="text-primary hover:underline">Contact MahaSandhi Team</a></p>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
